==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (Low-Yield)]] spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*5 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Firecracker]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Bore]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Firecracker]]s spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**10 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn, delay 1.67~3.33 seconds<sup>50f~100f</sup>.
**20 [[Firecracker]]s spawn, delay 1.67~3.33 seconds<sup>50f~100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Any generic [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|Anti-Red]] army should be capable of clearing this stage. Good picks include [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]], [[Witch Cat (Rare Cat)|Sorceress Cat]] and [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Dancing Flasher Cat]]. If you do happen to have trouble with the Bore, stall at the beginning to build up some money and a stack of debuffers.

